# Canonical Personal Agent Guidance

- Read and follow `~/.agents/AGENTS.md`; it is Luke's canonical cross-agent working agreement.
- Luke-authored personal skills have `author: Luke` and resolve through `~/.agents/skills/`.
- After a verified reusable correction or workflow, follow `personal-skill-maintenance` and update only the relevant Luke-authored skill in `luckycold/agent-skills`; the copies in `~/.agents/skills/` are reinstalled by skills.sh.
- Do not record secrets, transient state, or inferred preferences. Commit and push skill changes as `~/.agents/AGENTS.md` allows, and report each one.
